  "description": "Baek Seung-hyun, who travelled to Hong Kong to become a stunt actor, encounters the young and successful director Yu Cheon-hwa. However, due to his team leader’s scheming, Seung-hyun is sent to Cheon-hwa’s accommodation and forced to entertain him, causing Cheon-hwa to look down on Seung-hyun as if he were a worm. Amidst the growing misunderstanding, Cheon-hwa comes to recognise Seung-hyun’s character and acting talent, and gradually becomes intrigued by him... *(Source: Bomtoon, translated)*\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/UamHwaMyeong)",
